WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
So, I want to pick up in September 8, 1916, in Volume 11.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.000
And I have a VIP on this one, but as I warned you already, I probably have a VIP on everything now.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
For as long as the soul is in the divine will, notice as long.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
If it's 10 minutes, if it's 24 hours, all my life.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
For as long as the soul is in the divine will, so much of divine will can she say she lives on the earth.

6
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
In other words, if you're consciously in the divine will for 10 minutes, that's all.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.000
If you're there 24 hours, you can say, "Yes, I've lived the divine will for 24 hours."

8
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:49.000
And the whole idea is that we do it every day, every year.

9
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:57.000
The acts in the divine will are the simplest acts, so don't let anybody complicate you, okay?

10
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
They're the simplest acts.

11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.000
But because they are simple, they communicate themselves to everyone.

12
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Like if you take the light, which is very simple, and you get up in the morning,

13
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
and even though you've drawn the curtains or drawn the blinds,

14
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:18.000
the light has managed to get round them and under them and over them and everything else.

15
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.000
And you know it's day because the light has managed to get past the blocks you gave it.

16
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:26.000
It's because it's so simple it can do that.

17
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:30.000
So Louisa says after communion this morning,

18
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:37.000
"I felt that my beloved Jesus absorbed me completely into his will in a special way."

19
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Now she's been in his will for years, so into his will in a special way is obviously a new depth.

20
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.000
And I swam inside of it.

21
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.000
But who can say what I felt?

22
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.000
I have no words to express myself.

23
00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:02.000
And then Jesus told me, "My daughter, for as long as the soul is in my will,

24
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.000
so much of divine will can she say she lives on the earth."

25
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:15.000
How I like it when I see that the soul enters into my will to live divine will in it.

26
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:23.000
I like very much to see souls who repeat in my will what my humanity did in it.

27
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:25.000
I received communion.

28
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.000
I received myself in the will of the Father.

29
00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.000
And with this I not only repaired everything,

30
00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:39.000
but finding immensity and all seeingness of everywhere and everyone in the divine will,

31
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:43.000
I embraced all I gave communion to all.

32
00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:48.000
And in seeing that many would not take part in the sacrament,

33
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:56.000
and that the Father was offended for what they did not want to receive my life.

34
00:02:56.000 --> 00:03:01.000
Now these people, you're not talking about foreigners and people who don't know

35
00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.000
are people in false religions who don't know the truth.

36
00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:11.000
You're talking about Protestants and Catholics who claim to be Christians.

37
00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:15.000
And in seeing that many would not take part in the sacrament,

38
00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:20.000
and that the Father was offended for they did not want to receive my life,

39
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:26.000
I gave to the Father the satisfaction and the glory as if all had received communion.

40
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:34.000
You see, that's one of the things we need to do after communion is enter into his own reception of Holy Communion,

41
00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:39.000
take all of his acts, make them my own, offer them to him in the name of all,

42
00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:47.000
reparation and substitution for all souls past, present and future who cannot receive him wordily,

43
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:55.000
which includes me, and all those who refuse for whatever reason they refuse.

44
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.000
See, it's actually very simple.

45
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Everything in the divine will, a prayer in the divine will only has to take,

46
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:03.000
have a minute or a few seconds.

47
00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:08.000
They're not long lengthy things.

48
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:14.000
You too receive communion in my will and repeat what I did.

49
00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:17.000
He's told you there and then he says repeat it.

50
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:21.000
And in this way, you will not only repair everything,

51
00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:28.000
but you will give me to everyone as I intended to give myself to all

52
00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:34.000
and will give me the glory as if all had received communion.

53
00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.000
That's the beautiful thing we can do.

54
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.000
And how much you would want to do that for your children

55
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:47.000
or your grandchildren or your relatives who are not really receiving here.

56
00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:53.000
He said my heart feels moved in seeing that unable to give me anything from her own,

57
00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:59.000
which is worthy of me, the soul takes my things.

58
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:04.000
She makes them her own and she imitates the way I did it.

59
00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:12.000
So I take his acts, make them my own, offer them to him in reparation and substitution.

60
00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:16.000
And to please me, she gives them to me.

61
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:24.000
And I in my delight keep repeating, "Bravo, my daughter, you've done exactly what I did."

62
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:30.000
Then he added, "The acts in my will are the simplest acts."

63
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:34.000
And I know who's been told that twice in this one message.

64
00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:39.000
And because they are simple, they communicate themselves to everyone.

65
00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:45.000
The light of the sun, because it is simple, is the light of every eye.

66
00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:50.000
Yet the sun is only one thing, is only one son.

67
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:55.000
Just as one act in my will, like most simple light,

68
00:05:55.000 --> 00:06:01.000
diffuses itself into every heart, into every work and into every person.

69
00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:04.000
Yet it is only one act.

70
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:07.000
I'm trying to give you that in English, is that okay?

71
00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:14.000
My very being, because it is most simple, is one single act,

72
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:17.000
but an act which contains everything.

73
00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:25.000
Now the astrophysicists call that a singularity, a single spot,

74
00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:30.000
and it contains absolutely everything past, present and future.

75
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:35.000
I love the term singularity, it sort of tells you how tiny it is,

76
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:40.000
how complete it is, how total it is.

77
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:45.000
My very being, because it is most simple, is one single act,

78
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.000
but an act which contains everything.

79
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:51.000
It has no feet, but it's the step of all.

80
00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:54.000
It has no eyes, but it's the eye and the light of all.

81
00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:57.000
It gives life to everything.

82
00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:04.000
But with no effort, no toil, and yet it gives the ability to work to everyone.

83
00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:11.000
Now notice that when you are doing prayers in the Divine Will,

84
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:14.000
it seems as if you're not doing anything.

85
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:19.000
You know, you say, how can these few words have such an absolutely extraordinary effect,

86
00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:24.000
but he's trying to say to us that without labour and without toil,

87
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.000
he's able to affect everything.

88
00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:31.000
It's just that we have to kind of grasp what is this Divine Will.

89
00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:35.000
So the soul in my will becomes simple.

90
00:07:35.000 --> 00:07:38.000
Now that is a VIP point.

91
00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:43.000
We usually start out complicated, and then the Lord simplifies us,

92
00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:46.000
simplifies us, simplifies us.

93
00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:53.000
And together with me, she multiplies in all and does good to all.

94
00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:57.000
Oh, if all understood the immense value of the acts,

95
00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:05.000
even the simplest done in my will, they'd not let one act escape them.

96
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:13.000
I remember about two years ago, Tom Fahy came to visit me here in the house,

97
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:15.000
and we had our conversation.

98
00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.000
And then eventually he said, "What age are you?"

99
00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:20.000
So I told him my age, which was approximately his own.

100
00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:23.000
And he said, "Oh, you and I are in a hurry to do all our acts."

101
00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.000
He said, "We'll be brought home quicker than we think."

102
00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.000
No.

103
00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:31.000
I thought it was very interesting that we're in a hurry to do our acts.

104
00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:35.000
And yet it was such a simple thing to say.

105
00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:42.000
But his concentration was on doing what God wants us to do.

106
00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.000
Whatever he wants us to do, we're in a hurry.

107
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.000
The older we get, the more in a hurry we are.

108
00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.000
But things were rather interesting.

109
00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:55.000
So October the 2nd, 1916, the effects of communion in the Divine Will.

110
00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:58.000
This morning I received communion in the way Jesus had taught me.

111
00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.000
That is the way we've just described in the last message.

112
00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:06.000
That is united with his humanity, his divinity, and his will.

113
00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:13.000
And Jesus on coming made himself seen, and I kissed him and cast him to my heart.

114
00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:17.000
He returned my kiss and my embrace.

115
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:23.000
And he told me, "My daughter, how content I am, that you have come to receive me,

116
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:27.000
united with my humanity, divinity, and will."

117
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:35.000
You have renewed in me all the contentment I received when I communicated myself.

118
00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:40.000
And while you were kissing me and embracing me since all of myself was in you,

119
00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.000
you contained all souls.

120
00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:46.000
And I felt I was given the kiss of all.

121
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:48.000
That's the beauty, isn't it?

122
00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:52.000
And the embraces of all because this was your will.

123
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:59.000
And it was mine in communicating myself to return to the Father all the love of souls,

124
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.000
even though many do not love him.

125
00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:07.000
The Father made up for their love in me.

126
00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.000
You need to really look at that.

127
00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.000
Jesus said, "The Father and I are one."

128
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:13.000
You okay?

129
00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:17.000
So I want to give you John 15-9 as the Father has loved me.

130
00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:21.000
So I have loved you, so you should love one another.

131
00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:29.000
And to me, it's in the divine will that you can truly respond to that, John 15-9.

132
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:34.000
In fact, it's only at the level of the divine will that I think you can respond fully to,

133
