136
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.000
And we do it for all the others.

137
00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:53.000
That's your John 15-9.

138
00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:59.000
And having found in my will one who loves me and repairs me, et cetera, in the name of all,

139
00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:03.000
because in my will there's nothing that the creature cannot give me.

140
00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:08.000
Would you underline the nothing?

141
00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:14.000
There's nothing that you can't give him because you'll find everything in him.

142
00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:22.000
I feel like loving souls, even if they offend me, and I keep inventing strategies of love

143
00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:25.000
around the hardest hearts in order to convert them.

144
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:32.000
Only for love of these souls are the souls in my will, who do everything in my will,

145
00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:40.000
do I feel as though chained and captured, and I concede to them the projities of the greatest conversions.

146
00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:44.000
Now, will you know about these conversions? Most likely no.

147
00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.000
It's not good for you to know.

148
00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:55.000
What you will know in heaven when souls will come to you and say, "I'm here because of you."

149
00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.000
So that's a very beautiful message there.

150
00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:04.000
October the 13th, 1916, I have a VIP on this as well,

