Look at that, is that beautiful?

153
00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:19.000
These hours are sweet little sips that souls give to Jesus.

154
00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:23.000
So, Louisa said, "I was doing the hours of the Passion, and blessed Jesus told me,

155
00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:28.000
'My daughter, in the course of my mortal life, thousands and thousands of angels,

156
00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:34.000
were the courtage of my humanity, gathering everything I did, my steps, my works, my words,

157
00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:39.000
and even my size, my pains, the drops of my blood, everything.

158
00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:45.000
