00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:11.000
Thinking that the angels hang upon her lips to repeat after her what she says,

179
00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:19.000
and I love that. So, I say something in one of the hours the passion the angels are repeating it.

180
00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:25.000
In other words, the angel needs me to say it for them to be able to say it.

