183
00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:38.000
So, here you are on this level and the angels are there and we're joining together.

184
00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:42.000
I think it's beautiful, wouldn't it help you to say the hours of the passion?

185
00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:43.000
Yeah.

186
00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:48.000
So, then he added, "After so much bitterness the creatures give me,

187
00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:52.000
these hours are sweet little sips that souls give to me,

188
00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:56.000
but for the many bitter sips I receive the sweet ones are too few.

189
00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:59.000
Therefore, more diffusion, more diffusion."

190
00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.000
In other words, tell more people.

191
00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.000
Okay.

192
00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:08.000
So, October the 20th, 1916, grace is like sunlight,

193
00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:12.000
and it gives itself to everyone. That's beautiful, isn't it?

194
00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:15.000
I was fusing myself in the divine will,

195
00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:21.000
and the thought came to me of commending to it various people in a special way,

196
00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.000
because we're always praying for people, aren't we?

197
00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:27.000
And Jesus said, "My daughter,

198
00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:32.000
specificity is a big word. It goes by itself,

199
00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:35.000
even if you should not place the intention and the intention."

200
00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.000
It's very interesting.

201
00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:42.000
In other words, if you're talking about cups, you're talking about cups, not saucers.

202
00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:44.000
We need to actually be clear.

203
00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Like if we're communicating with each other, or delete,

204
