00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.000
She's not saying anything about anything.

207
00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:01.000
Do you know what I mean?

208
00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:04.000
Like, our communication has got to be directed,

209
00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:07.000
and it's got to be on a particular subject,

210
00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:08.000
and it's the same with prayer as well.

