and the post office up there says, "Well, who's this far?

218
00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:39.000
Who is the letter written to, and who is it supposed to benefit?"

219
00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:41.000
Because the prayer is just prayed.

220
00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.000
Do you know what I mean?

221
00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.000
Have you got me?

222
00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.000
Because prayers can be diffuse,

223
00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:50.000
and we're told to be specific.

224
00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:53.000
Like Jesus was very specific, our Father in Heaven.

